    "details": {
      "biography": {
        "value": "<p>Mid-fifties vault clerk at the C&V Hardby branch, and holder of one of the two vault keys. Former Aerdi treasury clerk; recognizes the firm's seals on sight. Methodical and deliberately incurious — he has not noticed that the &quot;special escrow&quot; Solen asks him to file in the side cabinet is not properly registered, and he does not read the marginal cipher he files past every day.</p>",
